# SpendWise – Personal Finance Dashboard

## Project Description
SpendWise is a personal finance dashboard designed to help users manage expenses, track monthly budgets, monitor spending categories and view savings.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- GitHub
- Netlify

## GitHub Repository
https://github.com/Abdull809/SpendWise

## Live Website
To be added after deployment on Netlify.

## Deployment Summary
The project is hosted on GitHub and will be deployed using Netlify. Automatic deployments will be enabled through GitHub integration.

## Challenges
- Connecting JavaScript to HTML.
- Managing expense calculations.
- Preparing the project for deployment.

## Lessons Learned
- How to organize a web development project.
- How to use GitHub for version control and hosting code.
- How to deploy a website using Netlify.
- How automatic deployment works.
